# Form: technical note

Use for reusable bounded technical knowledge, not transient progress or a replacement
for an authoritative contract. Default output: `docs/research/<topic>.md`. Copy only
payload with [metadata](../../references/metadata.md). Question, grounded findings,
applicability and conclusion are essential; remove unused alternatives/experiments.
An unknown remains explicit, not accepted architecture. For an actual experiment use
[research form](research.md.tmpl); for a behavior boundary use
[interface contract](interface-contract.md.tmpl).

